{"id":"258c3f0de8f3cacf","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation.md","title":"ZFC Graph Minor Relation","display":"df-zfc-graph-minor-relation — ZFC Graph Minor Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-minor-relation — ZFC Graph Minor Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-minor-relation — ZFC Graph Minor Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cb20ae7a7e543a78\" href=\"?note=cb20ae7a7e543a78\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle\">\\(H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\">\\(G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\)</span> (simple graphs, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S\\)</span> (connected-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cb20ae7a7e543a78\" href=\"?note=cb20ae7a7e543a78\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMinorRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMinorRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}minor\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphMinorRelation}_S(H,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists V_H,E_H,V_G,E_G\\;\\Bigl(H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle\\land G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(H)\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists b:V_H\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal P(V_G)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\\;\\bigl(\\forall u\\in V_H\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S\\bigl(\\langle b(u),E_G\\cap[b(u)]^2\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_H\\;(u\\neq v\\to b(u)\\cap b(v)=\\varnothing)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_H\\;\\bigl(\\{u,v\\}\\in E_H\\to\\exists x\\in b(u)\\;\\exists y\\in b(v)\\;(\\{x,y\\}\\in E_G)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}minor\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphMinorRelation}_S(H,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists V_H,E_H,V_G,E_G\\;\\Bigl(H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle\\land G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(H)\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists b:V_H\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal P(V_G)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\\;\\bigl(\\forall u\\in V_H\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S\\bigl(\\langle b(u),E_G\\cap[b(u)]^2\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_H\\;(u\\neq v\\to b(u)\\cap b(v)=\\varnothing)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_H\\;\\bigl(\\{u,v\\}\\in E_H\\to\\exists x\\in b(u)\\;\\exists y\\in b(v)\\;(\\{x,y\\}\\in E_G)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph codes are unpacked inside the assertion; the vertex and edge carriers are not hidden accessor primitives.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"cb20ae7a7e543a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle$ and $G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle$ (simple graphs, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"cb20ae7a7e543a78","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S$ (connected-graph predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMinorRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}minor\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphMinorRelation}_S(H,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists V_H,E_H,V_G,E_G\\;\\Bigl(H=\\langle V_H,E_H\\rangle\\land G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(H)\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists b:V_H\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal P(V_G)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\\;\\bigl(\\forall u\\in V_H\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S\\bigl(\\langle b(u),E_G\\cap[b(u)]^2\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_H\\;(u\\neq v\\to b(u)\\cap b(v)=\\varnothing)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_H\\;\\bigl(\\{u,v\\}\\in E_H\\to\\exists x\\in b(u)\\;\\exists y\\in b(v)\\;(\\{x,y\\}\\in E_G)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1577,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation.md|58-df-zfc-graph-minor-relation]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64","cb20ae7a7e543a78"]}